      "text": "A table titled \"EPI: Closed vial wastage rate by orgunit - last 12 months cumulative\", November 2015 to October 2016, giving the closed vial wastage rate (%) of seven vaccines (BCG, DPT-HepB-Hib, IPV, MR, OPV, PCV, RV) for two regions. Animal Region: 1.4, 1.2, 2.7, 1.3, 1.2, 1.2, 1.3. Food Region: 1.5, 1.2, 2.6, 1.2, 1.2, 1.3, 1.4. IPV has the highest rate in both.",
